summary.label:
This app can truly reflect users' consumption experience by restoring the consumption scene to the maximum extent via texts, pictures, videos etc. Firstly, enterprises can customize different types of survey tasks according to their own needs on this platform; secondly, after real name authentication, Anonym.Hi can claim various tasks based on their preferences, then conduct the survey, and finally complete the survey questionnaire claimed. Once passing the review, they can get a good reward.
This process adheres to the principle of voluntariness. This platform has also built a social platform where all consumption experiencers can participate in, thus co-creating a true chat platform for consumers.
 
Enterprises:
1. Customize personalized survey tasks;
2. Receive report, collect data and analyze data;
3. Use relevant data to support future decision-making and improve brand quality.

Mystery Guests:
1. Finish real name authentication in order to become Anonym.Hi;
2. Claim enterprise tasks they are interested in;
3. Complete tasks and submit data as required;
4. Get reward once passing questionnaire review.
 
Role of Anonym.Hi:
1. Build a communication bridge for enterprises and consumers;
2. Screen high-standard and high-quality experiencers for enterprises;
3. Collect personalized data for enterprises and provide constructive guidance on enterprise operation;
4. Provide an opportunity for those true Anonym.Hi to show themselves and have fun in it.
